data: {"id": "278efba42b8b4d1f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1286", "run_id": "278efba42b8b4d1f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`\n- **UID**: `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`\n- **Node**: `node2` (Ready)\n- **Phase**: Pending, **State**: ContainerCreating, **Restart Count**: 0\n- **容器**: `app` (image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, 无 imagePullPolicy 异常)\n\n### 支持的证据（根因已明确）\n1. **事件原文 (kubectl_events + kubectl_describe)**：\n   - `Warning FailedMount` (x19 over 25m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailab", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788770063487, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

