data: {"id": "278efba42b8b4d1f-final", "run_id": "278efba42b8b4d1f", "seq": 1291, "ts_ms": 1788770085818, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法进入 Running。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 3m5s (x19 over 25m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-9170ff0b847a) | 核心错误日志，明确指出挂载卷 `input` 因找不到 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 而失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory: 8Mi` (fact-15d03ed86b8f) | 排除因内存请求过大导致调度失败的可能 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` (fact-202e00064aed) | 排除因内存硬限制导致容器无法启动的可能 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-2c47ff5736f5) | 确认容器处于等待状态，尚未开始初始化 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending` (fact-681714820457) | 确认 Pod 停留在 Pending/ContainerCreating 阶段，未进入 Running |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (fact-9a30fedfed52, labels: container=app, reason=ContainerCreating) | 监控数据确认容器持续处于 ContainerCreating 等待态 |\n\n**证据小结：**\nKubernetes 事件 (fact-9170ff0b847a) 直接给出了失败原因：Volume 挂载因缺少 ConfigMap 而报错，且该错误在 25 分钟内反复出现 (x19)。配置 (fact-15d03ed86b8f, fact-202e00064aed) 显示资源限制合理，排除了资源不足。状态和监控 (fact-2c47ff5736f5, fact-9a30fedfed52) 一致证实了 Pod 卡在初始化阶段。Metric 无时序数据无法展示趋势，但单点值与事件频率吻合。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在 namespace 'aiops-case-03' 中缺失 → \nPod volume 'input' 引用不存在的 ConfigMap 且非可选 (Optional: false) → \nkubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败并触发 FailedMount 事件 (fact-9170ff0b847a) → \nPod 卡在 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 (fact-2c47ff5736f5, fact-681714820457)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod 依赖的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在**。\n\nPod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 的 YAML 配置中定义了一个名为 `input` 的卷，该卷引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。由于该 ConfigMap 未创建或未被引用（且配置非可选），Kubelet 在挂载卷步骤中无法找到对应的配置数据，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 永久失败。这一故障直接表现为 `FailedMount` 警告事件（fact-9170ff0b847a），并使得容器无法完成初始化，进而导致 Pod 始终处于 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 状态（fact-2c47ff5736f5, fact-681714820457），无法分配 IP 或启动任何业务逻辑。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 45.4s (Evidence 35.8s, RCA 9.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.283, "metrics": {"run_id": "278efba42b8b4d1f", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.29086923599243, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-sandbox-create-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 83290.86923599243, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 78834.90777015686, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 10356.310606002808, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4184.558629989624}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 25158.540725708008, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 45381.59489631653, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12729.7842502594, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

